The format to add actions are in a "action#=ItemID+Lv+Price" format, 
where "action" is self-described, 
"#" is the targeted page and 
ItemID+Lv+Price specifies the desired Item by it's ingame "ItemID" (see ItemIDs), the desired Level (1-10) and the Price discount desired, applied as a percentage (ex: 50 => 50 / 100 = 1/2 price)
Lv and Price are optional and will default to Level 1 and Price 100 if unspecified

First, choose a shop type:
[VarietyShop]
[BlacksmithShop]
[Restaurent]
[CrystalShop]
[Hospital]
[FlowerShop]
[VarietyShop2]
[CrystalShop2] //Rotating Stock
[BlacksmithShop2] //Ore Shop


Then decide if you want to:
    - Add items to an existing page (AddItem)
    - Replace items in an existing page (ReplaceItem)
    - Remove items from an existing page (RemoveItem)
    - Add a whole new page (NewPageName + NewPage)
        - Start with a NewPageName#, followed by NewPage#
        - NewPageName can only use the text predefined by the ingame UITextDic.DICID, other names will display blank
        - Many pages can be added, as definded by the #
All the actions can be combined together under the same shop.
Each action has to be followed by a number, representing the targeted page.

Examples:
Add items to existing pages
[BlacksmithShop2]
AddItem1=1502+2+50
Indicates the addition of Lumber Lv2 to the Blacksmith Ore Shop, with a 50% discount (multiplicative with PriceMultiplier!)

Replace existing items
[BlacksmithShop2]
ReplaceItem1=2152=2171+6
Replace Iron with Tenfold Steel Lv6 on page 1 of the Blacksmith Shop Ore Shop

Remove Existing Items
[BlacksmithShop2]
RemoveItem1=2152
Remove Iron item from Blacksmith Shop Ore Shop from page 1

Add new page
[BlacksmithShop2]
NewPageName1=SHOPCAT_Blacksmith_Stone_00
NewPage1=1502+4,1502+10
NewPageName2=SHOPCAT_Blacksmith_Stone_00
NewPage2=1503+10
Indicates the addition of Lumber Lv4 and Lumber Lv10 to the Blacksmith Ore Shop in the first new page, and adding Lv10 Material Stone to the second new page

Combine them all together
[BlacksmithShop2]
AddItem1=1502+2+50
RemoveItem1=2152
ReplaceItem1=2152=2171+6
NewPageName1=SHOPCAT_Blacksmith_Stone_00
NewPage1=1502+4,1502+10
NewPageName2=SHOPCAT_Blacksmith_Stone_00
NewPage2=1503+10

